        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo PP-3x15-628 Narrow Push Plates</b>\r\n<p>\r\nNarrow 3\" x 15\" push plate primarily used on aluminum store front doors, warehouses, factories and stores. Made of .050\" thick aluminum. Brushed aluminum with clear anodizing finish. Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-PP-3x15-628_size.gif?v=1704354651\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo PP-3x15-628 Narrow Push Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/narrow-3-x-15-pull-plate-don-jo-pp-3x15-31-628\"><b>3\" x 15\" Narrow Pull Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nEconomy priced for budget conscious projects, yet high quality .050\" thick solid non-rusting aluminum.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Don-Jo 3x15-628 Narrow Push Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Aluminum</b> with Clear Anodizing</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP-3x15-628.pdf?v=1704262349\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo PP-3x15-628 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> \r\n</p>",
